<title>HONG KONG: HK's Airport Authority extends Townsend's CEO term.</title>
<headline>HK's Airport Authority extends Townsend's CEO term.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Airport Authority said on Monday it had extended the term of its chief executive officer, Henry Townsend, up to the opening and through the initial phase of operation of the new Hong Kong airport.</p>
<p>The Chek Lap Kok airport is scheduled for an opening in April, 1998.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
